# Game of S.K.A.T.E. in the park inside sf (the same spot as in soma), against Tash (the Mission).
# She bails her first set; the bot sets an Ollie and she matches it; her BS 180 Heelflip lands
# sketchy, so it is your set again: a Kickflip.
park sf
cmd 0 run skate tash
bot skate
run 3000
expect event skateStart{local=tash,name=Tash,hood=the Mission} within 1..1
expect event skateSetMiss{by=local,reason=bail} within 585..593
expect event skateSet{by=player,trick=ollie} within 1154..1162
expect event skateMatch{by=local,ok=true,trick=ollie} within 1743..1751
expect event skateSetMiss{by=local,reason=sketchy,got=bs180+heelflip} within 2332..2340
expect event skateSet{by=player,trick=kickflip} within 2912..2920
expect no event skateLetter
expect session.skateTurn == local at end
expect session.skateRole == match at end
